WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.280
It all started with robotics for me when my brother
got a LEGO robot as a gift from America.

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:08.620
It seemed like he had an incredible tool
with incredible potential.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:12.850
But after a couple of weeks, he put that
LEGO robot in a drawer and forgot about it.

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.220
And then we realised that having
just equipment is not enough.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.530
It's also not enough to just have a robot
or just virtual reality glasses.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:23.180
You need engaging, motivating
and useful content.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:26.430
You need a group, and you need goals:
reasons for why you're doing it.

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:30.660
I want children and the younger generation,

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.930
young teenagers, to be ready
for the era of artificial intelligence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.400
What a Singapore partner gets: ready lessons, trained mentors, ExoClass.
Pilot term first, then a licence to run our programmes.
